 "notes": "1.3.1: 中文用字体改为直接替换游戏原版 game/gothic.ttf (Sarasa UI SC, 含中文字形, SIL OFL 1.1), 不再新增 fonts/ 目录文件, 也不覆写 gui 字体变量; gothic.ttf 作为 modified 条目可还原。 1.3.2: transparent translation added for game/images/zzzzjournal1.png. 1.3.3: PC payload drops mobile-only GUI settings, system-font fallback, and the custom title-particle layer. 1.3.4: added a Python-free single-file Windows GUI installer with progress feedback and diagnostic logging. 1.3.5: unified the Sixers terminology as 六时人, updated the opening captions and journal lettering with larger spaced italic WenKai typography, added a translated epilogue card, and translated save-screen labels; PC / Ren'Py 7.1.1 only. 1.3.6: corrected the three Pro journal image lines against the original English artwork. 1.3.7: refined the penultimate opening crawl sentence to preserve the future meaning of would liberate. 1.3.8: corrected and regenerated 17 book-note pages, 6 maps, and 4 tutorial images from English originals. 1.3.9: fixed 873 dialogue and UI translation lines (missing lines, brackets, terminology, honorifics), rebuilt and independently verified book-note, map and tutorial images, and added payload hash verification to check and install. 1.3.10: final terminology ruling (personal quarters as 个人房间, matching the rebuilt HQ map), pronoun follow-ups per English original, fourth HQ map remake from the English source, and gender-check false-positive fixes.",
